WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
Your college essays can literally be the most important part of your application,

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:07.440
because besides your activity list, colleges actually want to know if you

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:11.160
can express yourself, if you're unique, and if you are someone who is going

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.620
to be an asset to their campus.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:14.760
And that's why essays make such a big difference.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.860
That being said, though, so many people don't know how to write them

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:21.020
because it's genuinely not clear and they're missing out on this huge

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:24.780
opportunity to get thousands of dollars in scholarships for their essays,

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:27.860
or get into their dream schools that otherwise their GPA wouldn't

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:29.100
be able to get them into.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:32.160
That is why I do one-on-one college essay coaching.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:37.200
I got into every single college that I applied to, $600,000 in merit

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:41.180
scholarship offers total, a full tuition scholarship to Vanderbilt

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.060
because of my essays, because I had good grades, but I didn't have

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:48.980
remarkable extracurriculars, I didn't win any national STEM awards,

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:54.060
I didn't found a nonprofit, or do any sort of advanced research internships.

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.820
That is why my essays definitely moved the needle for me.

00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:00.000
And since then, I've worked with over a thousand high school students,

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:02.940
helping them write college essays that have gotten them into their dream

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:07.640
schools, like NYU with a full tuition scholarship, Vanderbilt with a scholarship,

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:11.140
UC Berkeley with the Regents scholarship, Cornell, Penn, Dartmouth,

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:14.680
and so many others, and these one-on-one essay calls are meant to get you

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:17.800
unstuck and help you figure out where to go and what to do, whether

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.480
you're brainstorming and you need help actually picking a topic, I can

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.460
help you, I can walk you through all seven prompts of the Common App

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:27.980
essays and help you land on a topic that I know for sure will stand out

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:32.080
since I've read over a thousand essays myself, or if you already have an idea,

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:35.060
but don't know how to make an outline, I can also help you with that.

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:38.060
I can help you make sure that it's detailed, that it includes things

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:41.500
that admissions officers are going to like, or if you have a draft, I

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:44.600
can read through your draft and give you detailed line-by-line feedback,

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:47.460
help you figure out what to add, what to cut, and how to make it

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:49.340
better so that it actually stands out.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:53.180
The essay is one of the most important parts of the application, and it is so

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:57.020
important that you get it right, which is why I offer this help to people.

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:59.940
Because the goal is that you leave our call feeling like,

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:02.180
hey, I kind of know what to do now.

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:05.420
And I'm not so worried about this because I know how stressful

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:08.420
senior year can get and how it can feel like you just don't

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:09.780
know where to go or what to do.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:11.660
That's what my expertise is for.

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:15.300
That being said, if you already just have a draft and you just want

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:19.580
written feedback, I do also offer an asynchronous version of one-on-one

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:22.780
coaching calls where you can just get written edits for me, but if you

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:26.820
would like the most tailored, specific one-on-one live feedback, then these

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:28.700
one-on-one calls are amazing for that.

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:31.260
So if you have any questions, you can email me at

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:34.100
abigaillang at gmail.com before you book, otherwise you

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:35.740
can book right here on this page.

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:38.420
I would love to work with you, and I can't wait to make sure that

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:40.380
you submit your essay feeling ready.
